      "Mix the minced pork with half the shallot, garlic, fish sauce, sugar, pepper and oil. Toss the belly slices with the rest. Marinate for at least 1 hour, up to overnight.",
      "Shape the mince into small flat patties about 5 cm wide.",
      "Stir the dipping sauce ingredients, except the carrot, until the sugar dissolves, then add the carrot and let it soften for 15 minutes.",
      "Grill the patties and pork belly over charcoal or a very hot grill pan for 3 to 4 minutes per side, until browned and cooked through.",
      "Cook the vermicelli in boiling water until just tender, then rinse in cold water and drain.",
      "Put the grilled pork in the dipping sauce, warm slightly if you like, and serve the vermicelli and herbs alongside for dipping."
